# Repro: the type/struct table caps at 256 entries. This file defines
# 257 structs, so `cyrius build` prints a bare "compile ... FAIL" and
# exits 1 — no diagnostic. Delete any one struct (256 total) and it
# builds. Plain or #derive(accessors) count the same; enums/type
# aliases share the table. Verified on cyrius 6.0.14, x86_64 linux.
#
#   cyrius build 2026-05-28-type-table-256-cap.cyr out   # -> FAIL, exit 1
#
